                "@type": "Question",
                "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-btn-1",
                "name": "What is the difference between Relai, Relai Private, and Relai Business?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-collapse-1",
                  "text": "Relai is for everyone who wants to buy and sell Bitcoin, starting with as little as 50 EUR/CHF via our mobile app.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nRelai Private is for individuals who want to trade beyond our default limits. Relai Private clients can buy or sell larger amounts of more than 100,000 EUR/CHF with exclusive personal service and expert guidance.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nRelai Business is for small to medium-sized businesses who want to add Bitcoin to their corporate balance sheets. With exclusive personal service and expert guidance."
                }
              },
              {
                "@type": "Question",
                "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-btn-2",
                "name": "How much do I pay in fees for buying &amp; selling Bitcoin?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-collapse-2",
                  "text": "Our transparent and competitive fee structure lets you get more bitcoin in your wallet.\r\n\r\n\r\n0.9% fees when using an invite code (10% off the regular 1% fee)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nZero fees on your first monthly auto-invest plan up to 100 CHF/€ – that’s up to 1,200 CHF/€ a year!\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nStart buying bitcoin from just 50 CHF/€\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBy adding an invite code, you can reduce their fees from the initial 1 % to the final fee of 0.9 % for orders up to 100,000 CHF/€ per transaction.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nCredit card, Apple Pay, and Google Pay payments incur an additional fee of 3.0% per transaction."
                }
              },
              {
                "@type": "Question",
                "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-btn-3",
                "name": "What is self-custody?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-collapse-3",
                  "text": "Relai offers a self-custodial wallet - which means we never hold your Bitcoin for you. Instead, your Bitcoin goes straight into a wallet that only you can access. Not us. Not anyone else. When you create your wallet in the app, you’ll get something called a recovery phrase - a secret backup that proves ownership. As long as you keep that phrase safe, your bitcoin is always yours."
                }
              },
              {
                "@type": "Question",
                "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-btn-4",
                "name": "How do I buy Bitcoin with Relai?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                  "@type": "Answer",
                  "@id": "https://relai.app#faq-collapse-4",
                  "text": "To buy Bitcoin with Relai, start by downloading the app from the App Store or Google Play. Tap the ( + ) button and choose ‘Buy’. Enter the amount you want, then select whether it's a one-time purchase or a recurring plan (weekly or monthly). Pick your payment method — either bank transfer or use a credit/debit card, Apple Pay, or Google Pay for instant purchases.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nYou can also add a referral code to save on fees and choose to send Bitcoin directly to an external wallet. Finally, review your order and confirm it."
                }
